=== Who shall abide
# from 17717, 8756
--- Who shall abide [title]
overline: The walk
heading: Who Shall Abide?
big: Psalm 15:1-2 | mark: who shall abide in thy tabernacle; He that walketh uprightly
center: We are a holy priesthood. We are heirs to a kingdom. We have hope everlasting. Act like it that others may attain the same.
big: Hebrews 12:13 | mark: make straight paths for your feet
